# Planning Docs

## PRD

Write PRDs to `docs/prd/<feature>.md` with: Problem, Users, User Stories, Non-Goals, Success Metrics, and Open Questions.

User stories must include P0, P1, or P2 priority and testable Given/When/Then acceptance criteria.

## Architecture

Write architecture docs to `docs/architecture/<feature>.md` with: Overview, API Contracts, Data Model, Module Boundaries, Async Jobs, Caching, and ADRs.

Shared contracts go in `packages/shared` before frontend and backend implementation begin in parallel.

## Design

Write screen specs to `docs/design/<feature>.md` when UI changes. Map every screen to `packages/ui` components and include empty, loading, error, success, and responsive states.
